// st8925lab Worker 設定 / Worker configuration (Phase 1, 2026-09-23)
//
// 在此之前 repo 沒有設定檔，Cloudflare Workers Builds 每次建置時自動產生：
// name=st8925lab、compatibility_date=2026-09-21、observability、assets.directory="."。
// 這裡原樣保留那些值，只新增 main／binding／run_worker_first，讓 /api/* 交給 Worker，
// 其餘路徑照舊直接由靜態資產回應（不經過 Worker）。
// Before this file existed, Workers Builds auto-generated the values above on every
// build. They are kept verbatim; only main / binding / run_worker_first are added so
// that /api/* reaches the Worker while every other path is still served straight
// from static assets.
//
// name 必須維持 "st8925lab"，否則 wrangler 會建立另一個新的 Worker。
// name MUST stay "st8925lab", otherwise wrangler creates a separate new Worker.
{
  "name": "st8925lab",
  "main": "worker/index.js",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-09-21",
  "observability": {
    "enabled": true
  },
  "assets": {
    "directory": ".",
    "binding": "ASSETS",
    "run_worker_first": ["/api/*"]
  }
}
